From 944465beab65f08bb981a9769d26a30e481eaf33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show profile name, verified name and business flag in chat
 info

The /contact/ reply already carries the name a contact chose for
themselves (pushname), a business's verified name and whether the
account is a business. The personal chat-info dialog now lists them,
skipping a name that only repeats the one already shown.

Client-only: nothing in WPPConnect or client/api_patches changes.
The logic lives in core/contact_identity.py with its own tests; the
three new strings are in every locale catalog.
